  "notes": [
    "Scene starts aligned sequentially to matching word SRT tokens. Original source audio and subtitles are unchanged.",
    "Eleven 1.2-second board transitions insert silence into narration. Scene placement holds for 0.5 seconds and moves for 0.6 seconds inside each existing narration interval."
  ],
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/01",
      "start": 0,
      "draw_start": 0.3,
      "draw_end": 3.84,
      "shrink_start": 4.34,
      "shrink_end": 4.94,
      "slide_start": 5.16,
      "end": 5.16,
      "narration": "Have you ever asked a sincere question, watched the room go quiet, and wondered what went wrong?"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/02",
      "start": 5.16,
      "draw_start": 5.46,
      "draw_end": 8.92,
      "shrink_start": 9.42,
      "shrink_end": 10.02,
      "slide_start": 10.24,
      "end": 10.24,
      "narration": "You thought you were examining an idea. Everyone else seemed to hear a criticism of their judgment."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/03",
      "start": 10.24,
      "draw_start": 10.54,
      "draw_end": 15.08,
      "shrink_start": 15.58,
      "shrink_end": 16.18,
      "slide_start": 16.4,
      "end": 16.4,
      "narration": "You explained more carefully, added missing details, and somehow made the conversation even more uncomfortable."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/04",
      "start": 16.4,
      "draw_start": 16.7,
      "draw_end": 19.98,
      "shrink_start": 20.48,
      "shrink_end": 21.08,
      "slide_start": 21.3,
      "end": 21.3,
      "narration": "Friedrich Nietzsche helps us explore that gap between what we mean and what others hear."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/05",
      "start": 21.3,
      "draw_start": 21.6,
      "draw_end": 25.17,
      "shrink_start": 25.67,
      "shrink_end": 26.27,
      "slide_start": 26.49,
      "end": 26.49,
      "narration": "But being misunderstood does not prove that you are unusually intelligent, or that you are right."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "board": 1,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/06",
      "start": 26.49,
      "draw_start": 26.79,
      "draw_end": 30.54,
      "shrink_start": 31.04,
      "shrink_end": 31.64,
      "slide_start": 31.86,
      "end": 33.06,
      "narration": "What happens when independent thought meets the habits, expectations, and fears of other people?"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/07",
      "start": 33.06,
      "draw_start": 33.36,
      "draw_end": 39.04,
      "shrink_start": 39.54,
      "shrink_end": 40.14,
      "slide_start": 40.36,
      "end": 40.36,
      "narration": "Nietzsche was a nineteenth-century philosopher who challenged inherited assumptions about morality, religion, and a valuable life."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/08",
      "start": 40.36,
      "draw_start": 40.66,
      "draw_end": 45.12,
      "shrink_start": 45.62,
      "shrink_end": 46.22,
      "slide_start": 46.44,
      "end": 46.44,
      "narration": "He became a professor of classical philology in Basel at twenty-four, studying ancient languages and literature."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/09",
      "start": 46.44,
      "draw_start": 46.74,
      "draw_end": 51.13,
      "shrink_start": 51.63,
      "shrink_end": 52.23,
      "slide_start": 52.45,
      "end": 52.45,
      "narration": "Persistent illness forced him to resign. His later writing developed outside the routine of university life."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/10",
      "start": 52.45,
      "draw_start": 52.75,
      "draw_end": 57.04,
      "shrink_start": 57.54,
      "shrink_end": 58.14,
      "slide_start": 58.36,
      "end": 58.36,
      "narration": "He spent many summers in Sils Maria, Switzerland, a mountain setting closely associated with his work."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/11",
      "start": 58.36,
      "draw_start": 58.66,
      "draw_end": 63.08,
      "shrink_start": 63.58,
      "shrink_end": 64.18,
      "slide_start": 64.4,
      "end": 64.4,
      "narration": "Yet loneliness does not automatically explain a philosophy, and suffering does not certify somebody's insight."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "board": 2,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/12",
      "start": 64.4,
      "draw_start": 64.7,
      "draw_end": 68.76,
      "shrink_start": 69.26,
      "shrink_end": 69.86,
      "slide_start": 70.08,
      "end": 71.28,
      "narration": "His challenge is to examine inherited values, including the flattering stories you tell about yourself."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/13",
      "start": 71.28,
      "draw_start": 71.58,
      "draw_end": 76.48,
      "shrink_start": 76.98,
      "shrink_end": 77.58,
      "slide_start": 77.8,
      "end": 77.8,
      "narration": "Imagine a family conversation where success means a prestigious job, a large income, and a respectable address."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/14",
      "start": 77.8,
      "draw_start": 78.1,
      "draw_end": 81.14,
      "shrink_start": 81.64,
      "shrink_end": 82.24,
      "slide_start": 82.46,
      "end": 82.46,
      "narration": "You ask whether that version of success would make you happy. The question seems reasonable."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/15",
      "start": 82.46,
      "draw_start": 82.76,
      "draw_end": 85.96,
      "shrink_start": 86.46,
      "shrink_end": 87.06,
      "slide_start": 87.28,
      "end": 87.28,
      "narration": "But someone who pursued those goals may hear you dismissing years of sacrifice and effort."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/16",
      "start": 87.28,
      "draw_start": 87.58,
      "draw_end": 92.2,
      "shrink_start": 92.7,
      "shrink_end": 93.3,
      "slide_start": 93.52,
      "end": 93.52,
      "narration": "Nietzsche's criticism of herd morality asks how collective values can constrain independent forms of life."
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/17",
      "start": 93.52,
      "draw_start": 93.82,
      "draw_end": 97.08,
      "shrink_start": 97.58,
      "shrink_end": 98.18,
      "slide_start": 98.4,
      "end": 98.4,
      "narration": "Applied here, the friction may concern belonging as much as the strength of your argument."
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "board": 3,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/18",
      "start": 98.4,
      "draw_start": 98.7,
      "draw_end": 102.76,
      "shrink_start": 103.26,
      "shrink_end": 103.86,
      "slide_start": 104.08,
      "end": 105.28,
      "narration": "That is a possibility, not a diagnosis. Your family might see risks you have overlooked."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/19",
      "start": 105.28,
      "draw_start": 105.58,
      "draw_end": 111.32,
      "shrink_start": 111.82,
      "shrink_end": 112.42,
      "slide_start": 112.64,
      "end": 112.64,
      "narration": "At work, everyone supports a plan. You notice a weakness and raise it during a meeting."
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/20",
      "start": 112.64,
      "draw_start": 112.94,
      "draw_end": 115.64,
      "shrink_start": 116.14,
      "shrink_end": 116.74,
      "slide_start": 116.96,
      "end": 116.96,
      "narration": "To you, identifying the problem is a contribution. To the presenter, it might feel like public embarrassment."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/21",
      "start": 116.96,
      "draw_start": 117.26,
      "draw_end": 122.24,
      "shrink_start": 122.74,
      "shrink_end": 123.34,
      "slide_start": 123.56,
      "end": 123.56,
      "narration": "One sentence can carry two messages: something about the plan, and something about the relationship between speakers."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/22",
      "start": 123.56,
      "draw_start": 123.86,
      "draw_end": 126.64,
      "shrink_start": 127.14,
      "shrink_end": 127.74,
      "slide_start": 127.96,
      "end": 127.96,
      "narration": "You need not hide the flaw. But the setting changes how your words arrive."
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/23",
      "start": 127.96,
      "draw_start": 128.26,
      "draw_end": 131.49,
      "shrink_start": 131.99,
      "shrink_end": 132.59,
      "slide_start": 132.81,
      "end": 132.81,
      "narration": "Do you want to improve the decision, display your insight, or quietly punish someone?"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "board": 4,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/24",
      "start": 132.81,
      "draw_start": 133.11,
      "draw_end": 137.48,
      "shrink_start": 137.98,
      "shrink_end": 138.58,
      "slide_start": 138.8,
      "end": 140.0,
      "narration": "Those motives can mix. Taking your intelligence seriously includes examining what you want from the exchange."
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/25",
      "start": 140.0,
      "draw_start": 140.3,
      "draw_end": 143.24,
      "shrink_start": 143.74,
      "shrink_end": 144.34,
      "slide_start": 144.56,
      "end": 144.56,
      "narration": "We can also share a vocabulary without sharing the experiences behind the words we use."
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/26",
      "start": 144.56,
      "draw_start": 144.86,
      "draw_end": 148.44,
      "shrink_start": 148.94,
      "shrink_end": 149.54,
      "slide_start": 149.76,
      "end": 149.76,
      "narration": "In Beyond Good and Evil, Nietzsche connects mutual understanding with the experiences people have in common."
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/27",
      "start": 149.76,
      "draw_start": 150.06,
      "draw_end": 153.96,
      "shrink_start": 154.46,
      "shrink_end": 155.06,
      "slide_start": 155.28,
      "end": 155.28,
      "narration": "Consider independence. For one person, it means the freedom to choose work that feels meaningful."
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/28",
      "start": 155.28,
      "draw_start": 155.58,
      "draw_end": 160.29,
      "shrink_start": 160.79,
      "shrink_end": 161.39,
      "slide_start": 161.61,
      "end": 161.61,
      "narration": "For another, it means reliable income after years of uncertainty. Both are defending something important."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/29",
      "start": 161.61,
      "draw_start": 161.91,
      "draw_end": 164.92,
      "shrink_start": 165.42,
      "shrink_end": 166.02,
      "slide_start": 166.24,
      "end": 166.24,
      "narration": "Debating the word without uncovering those experiences can take you further from each other."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "board": 5,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/30",
      "start": 166.24,
      "draw_start": 166.54,
      "draw_end": 169.96,
      "shrink_start": 170.46,
      "shrink_end": 171.06,
      "slide_start": 171.28,
      "end": 172.48,
      "narration": "Ask what the idea means in their life. A concrete example may reveal the disagreement."
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/31",
      "start": 172.48,
      "draw_start": 172.78,
      "draw_end": 177.16,
      "shrink_start": 177.66,
      "shrink_end": 178.26,
      "slide_start": 178.48,
      "end": 178.48,
      "narration": "Nietzsche also explores masks: the distance between an inward life and the version others encounter."
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/32",
      "start": 178.48,
      "draw_start": 178.78,
      "draw_end": 182.36,
      "shrink_start": 182.86,
      "shrink_end": 183.46,
      "slide_start": 183.68,
      "end": 183.68,
      "narration": "A reserved person may appear indifferent. Someone who speaks carefully may seem to feel nothing."
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/33",
      "start": 183.68,
      "draw_start": 183.98,
      "draw_end": 189.57,
      "shrink_start": 190.07,
      "shrink_end": 190.67,
      "slide_start": 190.89,
      "end": 190.89,
      "narration": "These are illustrations, not personality rules. Silence has many meanings, and appearances need patient interpretation."
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/34",
      "start": 190.89,
      "draw_start": 191.19,
      "draw_end": 194.68,
      "shrink_start": 195.18,
      "shrink_end": 195.78,
      "slide_start": 196.0,
      "end": 196.0,
      "narration": "You cannot give every acquaintance unrestricted access to your inner life. You do not owe that."
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/35",
      "start": 196.0,
      "draw_start": 196.3,
      "draw_end": 200.12,
      "shrink_start": 200.62,
      "shrink_end": 201.22,
      "slide_start": 201.44,
      "end": 201.44,
      "narration": "Still, concealing everything that matters gives other people less evidence with which to understand you."
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "board": 6,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/36",
      "start": 201.44,
      "draw_start": 201.74,
      "draw_end": 205.56,
      "shrink_start": 206.06,
      "shrink_end": 206.66,
      "slide_start": 206.88,
      "end": 208.08,
      "narration": "Sometimes a plain sentence helps: I care about this, and I need a moment to explain."
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/37",
      "start": 208.08,
      "draw_start": 208.38,
      "draw_end": 213.6,
      "shrink_start": 214.1,
      "shrink_end": 214.7,
      "slide_start": 214.92,
      "end": 214.92,
      "narration": "Nietzsche associates intellectual independence with solitude, with enough distance to resist repeating the opinions around you."
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/38",
      "start": 214.92,
      "draw_start": 215.22,
      "draw_end": 217.99,
      "shrink_start": 218.49,
      "shrink_end": 219.09,
      "slide_start": 219.31,
      "end": 219.31,
      "narration": "An unfinished idea may need quiet before it can survive the demands of a conversation."
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/39",
      "start": 219.31,
      "draw_start": 219.61,
      "draw_end": 224.36,
      "shrink_start": 224.86,
      "shrink_end": 225.46,
      "slide_start": 225.68,
      "end": 225.68,
      "narration": "But solitude can protect a mistake. Without challenges, an appealing explanation can harden into certainty."
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/40",
      "start": 225.68,
      "draw_start": 225.98,
      "draw_end": 230.02,
      "shrink_start": 230.52,
      "shrink_end": 231.12,
      "slide_start": 231.34,
      "end": 231.34,
      "narration": "Try alternating reflection with contact: think privately, then let a serious objection reach you."
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/41",
      "start": 231.34,
      "draw_start": 231.64,
      "draw_end": 234.52,
      "shrink_start": 235.02,
      "shrink_end": 235.62,
      "slide_start": 235.84,
      "end": 235.84,
      "narration": "Seek someone who can restate your position fairly and show you where it needs more work."
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "board": 7,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/42",
      "start": 235.84,
      "draw_start": 236.14,
      "draw_end": 239.61,
      "shrink_start": 240.11,
      "shrink_end": 240.71,
      "slide_start": 240.93,
      "end": 242.13,
      "narration": "That disagreement offers something flattery cannot: a chance to improve an idea you care about."
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/43",
      "start": 242.13,
      "draw_start": 242.43,
      "draw_end": 247.24,
      "shrink_start": 247.74,
      "shrink_end": 248.34,
      "slide_start": 248.56,
      "end": 248.56,
      "narration": "Here is the tempting mistake: deciding every difficult conversation proves you are surrounded by shallow people."
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/44",
      "start": 248.56,
      "draw_start": 248.86,
      "draw_end": 253.2,
      "shrink_start": 253.7,
      "shrink_end": 254.3,
      "slide_start": 254.52,
      "end": 254.52,
      "narration": "Then criticism confirms your superiority, and agreement proves that someone finally understands what you mean."
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/45",
      "start": 254.52,
      "draw_start": 254.82,
      "draw_end": 258.63,
      "shrink_start": 259.13,
      "shrink_end": 259.73,
      "slide_start": 259.95,
      "end": 259.95,
      "narration": "It is a protected belief. Nothing can count against it, which makes learning almost impossible."
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/46",
      "start": 259.95,
      "draw_start": 260.25,
      "draw_end": 265.03,
      "shrink_start": 265.53,
      "shrink_end": 266.13,
      "slide_start": 266.35,
      "end": 266.35,
      "narration": "Nietzsche questions the motives behind philosophical claims. That suspicion can reach our comforting stories too."
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/47",
      "start": 266.35,
      "draw_start": 266.65,
      "draw_end": 271.81,
      "shrink_start": 272.31,
      "shrink_end": 272.91,
      "slide_start": 273.13,
      "end": 273.13,
      "narration": "Perhaps your point was sound. Perhaps your timing was poor, your example confusing, your evidence insufficient."
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "board": 8,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/48",
      "start": 273.13,
      "draw_start": 273.43,
      "draw_end": 277.73,
      "shrink_start": 278.23,
      "shrink_end": 278.83,
      "slide_start": 279.05,
      "end": 280.25,
      "narration": "Considering those alternatives is more useful than protecting an identity built around being the misunderstood genius."
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/49",
      "start": 280.25,
      "draw_start": 280.55,
      "draw_end": 285.79,
      "shrink_start": 286.29,
      "shrink_end": 286.89,
      "slide_start": 287.11,
      "end": 287.11,
      "narration": "Apply the same care to Nietzsche. His writing is provocative, compressed, and often resists easy interpretation."
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/50",
      "start": 287.11,
      "draw_start": 287.41,
      "draw_end": 291.06,
      "shrink_start": 291.56,
      "shrink_end": 292.16,
      "slide_start": 292.38,
      "end": 292.38,
      "narration": "His language of rank and higher types is elitist. It cannot be translated into intelligence scores."
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/51",
      "start": 292.38,
      "draw_start": 292.68,
      "draw_end": 295.95,
      "shrink_start": 296.45,
      "shrink_end": 297.05,
      "slide_start": 297.27,
      "end": 297.27,
      "narration": "Nor should objections to his ideas be dismissed as failures to understand a brilliant outsider."
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/52",
      "start": 297.27,
      "draw_start": 297.57,
      "draw_end": 301.28,
      "shrink_start": 301.78,
      "shrink_end": 302.38,
      "slide_start": 302.6,
      "end": 302.6,
      "narration": "You can learn from his challenge to conformity while rejecting conclusions you find poorly supported."
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/53",
      "start": 302.6,
      "draw_start": 302.9,
      "draw_end": 306.28,
      "shrink_start": 306.78,
      "shrink_end": 307.38,
      "slide_start": 307.6,
      "end": 307.6,
      "narration": "Become a more demanding reader, including of the thinker who seems to explain your loneliness."
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "board": 9,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/54",
      "start": 307.6,
      "draw_start": 307.9,
      "draw_end": 310.74,
      "shrink_start": 311.24,
      "shrink_end": 311.84,
      "slide_start": 312.06,
      "end": 313.26,
      "narration": "If a philosophy always tells you that you were right, ask what it leaves unexamined."
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/55",
      "start": 313.26,
      "draw_start": 313.56,
      "draw_end": 316.46,
      "shrink_start": 316.96,
      "shrink_end": 317.56,
      "slide_start": 317.78,
      "end": 317.78,
      "narration": "What can you do when a thoughtful comment lands badly? Start by making the claim smaller."
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/56",
      "start": 317.78,
      "draw_start": 318.08,
      "draw_end": 322.33,
      "shrink_start": 322.83,
      "shrink_end": 323.43,
      "slide_start": 323.65,
      "end": 323.65,
      "narration": "Instead of condemning the whole plan, identify the assumption you doubt and explain why it matters."
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/57",
      "start": 323.65,
      "draw_start": 323.95,
      "draw_end": 326.39,
      "shrink_start": 326.89,
      "shrink_end": 327.49,
      "slide_start": 327.71,
      "end": 327.71,
      "narration": "Give one example they can inspect. Let them see the steps that brought you there."
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/58",
      "start": 327.71,
      "draw_start": 328.01,
      "draw_end": 330.94,
      "shrink_start": 331.44,
      "shrink_end": 332.04,
      "slide_start": 332.26,
      "end": 332.26,
      "narration": "Ask what they heard you saying. They may have answered a harsher claim than you intended."
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/59",
      "start": 332.26,
      "draw_start": 332.56,
      "draw_end": 337.31,
      "shrink_start": 337.81,
      "shrink_end": 338.41,
      "slide_start": 338.63,
      "end": 338.63,
      "narration": "If your tone caused harm, repair it without pretending your concern disappeared. Consideration can support clarity."
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "board": 10,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/60",
      "start": 338.63,
      "draw_start": 338.93,
      "draw_end": 343.69,
      "shrink_start": 344.19,
      "shrink_end": 344.79,
      "slide_start": 345.01,
      "end": 346.21,
      "narration": "These are practical extensions, not a communication manual Nietzsche wrote. Their value is in trying them."
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/61",
      "start": 346.21,
      "draw_start": 346.51,
      "draw_end": 351.13,
      "shrink_start": 351.63,
      "shrink_end": 352.23,
      "slide_start": 352.45,
      "end": 352.45,
      "narration": "Sometimes your explanation is clear, and the other person still disagrees. Understanding does not require agreement."
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/62",
      "start": 352.45,
      "draw_start": 352.75,
      "draw_end": 356.27,
      "shrink_start": 356.77,
      "shrink_end": 357.37,
      "slide_start": 357.59,
      "end": 357.59,
      "narration": "Sometimes a tired friend needs companionship tonight and a philosophical debate on another day."
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/63",
      "start": 357.59,
      "draw_start": 357.89,
      "draw_end": 363.09,
      "shrink_start": 363.59,
      "shrink_end": 364.19,
      "slide_start": 364.41,
      "end": 364.41,
      "narration": "Some relationships offer little room for honest questions. Recognize that limit without declaring yourself superior."
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/64",
      "start": 364.41,
      "draw_start": 364.71,
      "draw_end": 368.6,
      "shrink_start": 369.1,
      "shrink_end": 369.7,
      "slide_start": 369.92,
      "end": 369.92,
      "narration": "Seek conversations with curiosity on both sides, where questions and changes of mind are welcome."
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/65",
      "start": 369.92,
      "draw_start": 370.22,
      "draw_end": 374.33,
      "shrink_start": 374.83,
      "shrink_end": 375.43,
      "slide_start": 375.65,
      "end": 375.65,
      "narration": "A few people who engage seriously can make your thinking less isolated. You need no universal audience."
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "board": 11,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/66",
      "start": 375.65,
      "draw_start": 375.95,
      "draw_end": 380.09,
      "shrink_start": 380.59,
      "shrink_end": 381.19,
      "slide_start": 381.41,
      "end": 382.61,
      "narration": "Offer them the patience you want, especially when their experience makes your certainty uncomfortable."
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 1,
      "image": "images/67",
      "start": 382.61,
      "draw_start": 382.91,
      "draw_end": 386.04,
      "shrink_start": 386.54,
      "shrink_end": 387.14,
      "slide_start": 387.36,
      "end": 387.36,
      "narration": "Return to that quiet room after your question. Several stories could explain what just happened."
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 2,
      "image": "images/68",
      "start": 387.36,
      "draw_start": 387.66,
      "draw_end": 391.35,
      "shrink_start": 391.85,
      "shrink_end": 392.45,
      "slide_start": 392.67,
      "end": 392.67,
      "narration": "You may have touched a protected assumption, missed an emotional context, or simply been wrong."
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 3,
      "image": "images/69",
      "start": 392.67,
      "draw_start": 392.97,
      "draw_end": 398.08,
      "shrink_start": 398.58,
      "shrink_end": 399.18,
      "slide_start": 399.4,
      "end": 399.4,
      "narration": "Intellectual independence includes examining all three possibilities, rather than automatically choosing the most flattering one."
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 4,
      "image": "images/70",
      "start": 399.4,
      "draw_start": 399.7,
      "draw_end": 404.21,
      "shrink_start": 404.71,
      "shrink_end": 405.31,
      "slide_start": 405.53,
      "end": 405.53,
      "narration": "You can defend a difficult idea while improving its expression, testing its evidence, and listening carefully."
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 5,
      "image": "images/71",
      "start": 405.53,
      "draw_start": 405.83,
      "draw_end": 410.04,
      "shrink_start": 410.54,
      "shrink_end": 411.14,
      "slide_start": 411.36,
      "end": 411.36,
      "narration": "Being misunderstood hurts. It need not become your identity, your proof of greatness, or your excuse."
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "board": 12,
      "cell": 6,
      "image": "images/72",
      "start": 411.36,
      "draw_start": 411.66,
      "draw_end": 414.864,
      "shrink_start": 415.364,
      "shrink_end": 415.964,
      "slide_start": 416.184,
      "end": 416.184,
      "narration": "Make your thinking worth understanding, then give another person a fair chance to meet it."
    }
  ],
  "animation": {
    "mode": "available-space",
    "pause_seconds": 0.5,
    "move_seconds": 0.6
  }
}
